<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">FLM - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA FILEMONI</para>
  <para style="h">MARUBA EMWA FILEMONI</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA FILEMONI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku maruba emwa Filemoni</para>
  <para style="ip">Oyo mulume mushigwa Filemoni aligwêrhe omujà, ye wali Onezimo. Filemoni abatizibwa ahinduka mukristu. Omujà ayâka Nnawâbo n’obwo okwo kwàli kucîhira omu kâga. Lêro erhi acirhigâna Paolo, Onezimo ayêmêra Yezu anabatizibwa. Bulya Paolo akengaga obubatizo burhujira bantu bahyâhya, agerêreza erhi: «Oyu wali mujà akola mwene wîrhu erhi bubatizo burhuma; kandi akola mwene wâbo Filemoni na ntyo Filemoni naye ali mwene wîrhu.» Nkaba akengêra birya ayandikiraga Abagalasiya (3, 27-29), halya adesire oku ababatizibwe barhacirimwo kabôlo ekarhî K’Omuyahudi n’Omugereki, kwo kuderha orhali Muyahudi, ntagengwa n’omujà, omulume n’omukazi. Go mango ayandikire Filemoni aga maruba. Mofi ci galimwo emyanzi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Paolo, mubohe wa Kristu Yezu, na mwene wîrhu Timoteyo, kuli Filemoni, murhabâzi wîrhu muzigirwa, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>na mwâli wîrhu Afiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afiya: Nkaba mukà Filemoni oyo. </char></note>, n’owîrhu rhulwa entambala rhweshi naye, Arkipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arkipo: Nkaba mugala wa Filemoni.</char></note>, haguma n’endêko y’abemêzi babugânana aha mwâwe: <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>enshôkano n’obuholo bimmugabirwe na Larha Nyamuzinda na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu!<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo avuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ntahusa kuvuga Nyamuzinda wâni omunkwa nka nakukengêra omu nsengero zâni, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>bulya nankâyumva baderha obuzigire n’obuyêmêre bwâwe kuli Nyakasane Yezu n’oku batagatîfu boshi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Owabona ecinyabuguma c’obuyêmêre bwâwe ciyôrha cikanyire cinakurhabâle okumanya aminjà goshi rhwankahash’ijira erhi Kristu orhuma! <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Nêci okuli, mwene wîrhu, nsîmire bwenêne nanayumva oburhûlirize erhi buzigire bwâwe burhuma, bulya warhulirîze emirhima y’abatagatîfu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo alagira Onezimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Co cirhumire, ciru akabà ngwêrhe obuhashe muli Kristu bw’okukurhegeka ebi okwânîne okujira, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>nnonzize nkuyinginge erhi kwo erhi buzigire burhuma. Nie Paolo, olya mushosi Paolo, oli buno mubohe wa Kristu Yezu! <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Nsengerîre mugala wâni naburhiraga omu mpamikwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naburhiraga omu mpamikwa: Erhi Paolo amyigîriza Onezimo enjira y’obuyêmêre, amuburha iroho.</char></note>, oyûla Onezimo. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Mîra ntâco akukwânîne, ci lêro bunôla akola âkukwânana bwenêne, ana­nkwânine nâni. <verse eid="PHM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Y’oyo nkurhumîre; ye murhima gwâni. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Nankasîmire mmuyôrhane, nti antabâle ahâli hâwe muno nkoba ndimwo erhi Myanzi y’Akalembe erhuma; <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>ci naderha nti ntankajira akantu ntanakudôsizi, nti lyo orhasêzibwa okujira ecinjà, ci ocikole oku bulonza bwâwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Nkaba Onezimo arhanzir’ikubunga mango masungunu mpu muyish’ibêra naye ensiku n’amango, <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>ci arhaciri nka mujà wâwe, ci kulusha omujà: nka mwene winyu muzigirwa. Ali ye lwoshi lwoshi kuli nie; kanga kulusha abà ye kuli we oku mubiri na muli Nyakasane! <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Lêro akabà oyêmîre oku rhuyinjibana rhwembi, omuyankirire nk’oku wankanyankirira. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>N’akabà akujirîre kubî, nîsi erhi akabà akubà omu mwenda, abage erhi nie oyîsh’idôsa. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Niene Paolo nkuyandikîre n’okuboko kwâni: nie nâkulyûle. Ntanarhama nakubwîra oku nâwe ondi omu mwenda, n’ogwo mwenda oli w’oyo wênene. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Nêci, mwene wîrhu, onjirire okwo muli Nyakasane! Orhûlirize omurhima gwâni muli Kristu! <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Nkuyandikîre n’obulangalire nti wanyumva, nnamanyire oku wajira ciru n’ebilushire ebi mpûnyire.<verse eid="PHM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akanwa kazinda, omusingo n’obwangà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Onteganyize n’ecirâlo, bulya ndangâlîre nti n’oburhabâle bw’ensengero zinyu nammugalulirwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epafra rhubà rhweshi babohe muli Kristu Yezu akulamusize, <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>bo na Marko, Aristarko, Dema, na Luka, bo barhabâzi bâni. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Enshôkano ya Nyakasane Yezu Kristu ebêre omu mirhima yinyu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
